SAKNIYA — Complete Housing, Roommate Matching & Rental Platform

Web + iOS + Android | Full-Stack Product Specification

You are a senior product designer, UX researcher, full-stack engineer, mobile developer, database architect, AI engineer, and security specialist.

Build Sakniya (سكنية), a complete housing platform for university students and employees in Egypt. The platform should combine the best housing discovery and booking experiences of Airbnb with a dedicated roommate compatibility system, verified listings, secure booking workflows, interactive maps, and an AI assistant named Misbah (مصباح).

This must be a real, functional application, not a static landing page or a collection of mockup screens.

Create a responsive web app and cross-platform iOS/Android app using a shared backend and consistent design system. If both platforms cannot be delivered in one environment, clearly separate the web and mobile implementations while sharing the same database, API, validation rules, and business logic.

